cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository to collect VIVO metadata, cite this helper repository. If you run or cite the FORCE-on-Airflow workflow or its scientific results, cite the upstream workflow and the FORCE software listed in the references."
title: "Long-term Vegetation Dynamics (Airflow) VIVO Metadata"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kati
    given-names: Yagmur
repository-code: "https://github.com/YagmurKati/long-term-vegetation-airflow-vivo-metadata"
url: "https://github.com/YagmurKati/long-term-vegetation-airflow-vivo-metadata"
date-released: 2026-08-05
license: MIT
abstract: "Helper scripts and documentation for collecting Airflow, Kubernetes, Prometheus, energy, carbon, and input-dataset metadata from finished FORCE-on-Airflow workflow runs, and exporting it as VIVO-ready Turtle. This repository does not contain the workflow itself; the Airflow DAG lives in the upstream repository."
keywords:
  - VIVO
  - metadata
  - provenance
  - Airflow
  - Kubernetes
  - FORCE
  - Earth observation
